  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "產業分析與評價",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRY ANALYSIS AND VALUE ASSESSMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程由財務報表與產業前景分析著手，將企業評價植基於財務報表與產業前景分析的基礎上，搭配實務個案及產業分析,使同學能透過本課程有效瞭解企業的營運狀況，並能對企業未來的經營績效進行完整的預測與評價。",
    "describe_eh": "This course starts with the analysis of financial statements and industry prospects, based on the analysis of financial statements and industry prospects, and is combined with practical case analysis (such as traditional manufacturing evaluation analysis, biotechnology industry company evaluation, chain retail industry evaluation analysis compared with enterprise evaluation analysis (same industry), etc.). Students can effectively understand how to master the business structure, business performance, financial quality and risks of the company through this course, and can fully predict and evaluate the future business performance of the company.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
